{"bodyHtml":"\n \n <div id=root><div class=\"App grain\"><main class=\"relative z-[2]\"><section class=\"relative pt-40 lg:pt-48 pb-20 lg:pb-24 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-royal/15 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16\"><div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] uppercase text-royal\" style=font-family:Satoshi>Get In Touch</span></div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><h1 class=\"mt-6 text-5xl md:text-7xl leading-[1.02] font-serif text-cream\">Let's Build Something <span class=\"italic text-cream/60\">Worth Talking About.</span></h1></div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><p class=\"mt-8 text-lg text-cream/60 max-w-lg font-light\">Tell us what you're working on — a campaign, a brand, a website, or a wedding — and we'll come back with a clear next step.</p></div><div style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)><div class=\"mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;\"><a href=https://wa.me/910000000000 target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-center gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-[#25D366]/20 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg width=20 height=20 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-width=2 stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle text-[#25D366]\" aria-hidden=true><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=text-cream>Prefer a faster answer?<p class=\"text-sm text-cream/50\">Message us directly on WhatsApp</p></div></a><a href=https://instagram.com/ target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=\"glass rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-center gap-4 hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-royal/20 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg width=20 height=20 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-width=2 stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round class=\"lucide lucide-instagram text-royal\" aria-hidden=true><rect width=20 height=20 x=2 y=2 rx=5 ry=5></rect><path d=\"M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z\"></path><line x1=17.5 x2=17.51 y1=6.5 y2=6.5></line></svg></span><div><p class=text-cream>Follow the build-in-public journey<p class=\"text-sm text-cream/50\">@driftdigitally on Instagram</p></div></a></div></div></div><div style=opacity:1;transform:none><div class=\"glass rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10\"><form class=space-y-5 data-testid=contact-form><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5\"><div><label class=\"text-sm text-cream/60 block mb-2\">Name *</label><input data-testid=contact-name class=\"w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-cream outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-royal focus:border-royal transition-colors placeholder:text-cream/30\" placeholder=\"Your name\"></div><div><label class=\"text-sm text-cream/60 block mb-2\">Email *</label><input data-testid=contact-email class=\"w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-cream outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-royal focus:border-royal transition-colors placeholder:text-cream/30\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" type=\"email\"></div></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-5\"><div><label class=\"text-sm text-cream/60 block mb-2\">Phone Number</label><input data-testid=contact-phone class=\"w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-cream outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-royal focus:border-royal transition-colors placeholder:text-cream/30\" placeholder=\"+91 98765 43210\" type=\"tel\"></div><div><label class=\"text-sm text-cream/60 block mb-2\">Company / Brand Name</label><input data-testid=contact-company class=\"w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-cream outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-royal focus:border-royal transition-colors placeholder:text-cream/30\" placeholder=\"Optional for personal projects\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-5\"><label class=\"text-sm text-cream/60 block mb-2\">What are you looking to build? *</label><select data-testid=contact-interest class=\"custom-dark-select w-full px-5 py-4 text-cream cursor-pointer\"><option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select an option</option><option value=\"Digital Growth &amp; Performance\">Digital Growth &amp; Performance</option><option value=\"AI Content\">AI Content</option><option value=\"Branding &amp; Creative Studio\">Branding &amp; Creative Studio</option><option value=\"Wedding Stationery\">Wedding Stationery</option><option value=\"Web Development\">Web Development</option><option value=\"Not Sure Yet\">Not Sure Yet</option></select></div><div><label class=\"text-sm text-cream/60 block mb-2\">Project details *</label><textarea data-testid=contact-details rows=5 class=\"w-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-5 py-4 text-cream outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-royal focus:border-royal transition-colors placeholder:text-cream/30 resize-none\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your project, timeline, and goals...\"></textarea></div><button data-testid=contact-submit class=\"w-full bg-royal text-white rounded-full py-4 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-cream hover:text-ink transition-colors disabled:opacity-60 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Send It Over <svg xmlns=http://www.w3.org/2000/svg width=18 height=18 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-width=2 stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=true><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></button></form></div></div></div></section></main><a data-testid=whatsapp-button href=\"https://wa.me/910000000000?text=Hi%20Drift%20Digitally%2C%20I%27d%20love%20to%20talk%20about%20a%20project.\" target=_blank rel=noreferrer class=\"fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#25D366] text-white rounded-full shadow-2xl shadow-[#25D366]/30 pl-4 pr-4 py-4 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><svg width=24 height=24 viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=currentColor aria-hidden=true><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.511-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z\"></path></svg></a><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=-1 aria-live=polite aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=false></section></div></div>\n \n \n \n","cssUrl":"/styles/page-contact.css"}